'''Salandit''' (Japanese: '''ヤトウモリ''' ''Yatoumori'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

